n the modulation of MAP3K3-dependent p38 activation induced by hyperosmotic shock (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}